EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Look who's come to {{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
You're looking especially, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}well, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}vivid
this morning, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Must be all the extra sunlight today!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
The {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Summer Solstice {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}brings out the
best in everyone, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Mira quién ha venido a {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Esta mañana estás más activ{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
que nunca, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Será por el solsticio de verano.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Tener más horas de sol anima
a todo el mundo, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Oh, mais regardez qui nous arrive à
{{TAG:0005:0005:}} ce matin !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Tu as l'air...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
comment dire... {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}radieux, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tout comme ce soleil en fait !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}. Ce solstice d'été 
commence bien.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Guarda chi c'è {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ti vedo particolarmente, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}beh, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}solare
stamattina, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Dev'essere tutto questo sole!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Il solstizio d'estate illumina il lato
migliore di tutti noi, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Quelle fière allure, {{TAG:0005:0000:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Tu as donc choisi le jour du solstice
pour venir nous voir, {{TAG:0005:0007:}} ?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Good evening?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
No, no. That would be silly of me.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Good solstice, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}The sun isn't setting tonight.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
So enjoy {{TAG:0005:0005:}} in a whole
new light tonight, OK?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Buenas noches?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
No, no... eso no tiene sentido.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡Buen solsticio, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hoy no se hará de noche,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0022:}} y la
verdad, tanto sol me abruma...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Me voy a dar un baño relajante
mientras leo la prensa rosa.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bonsoir ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Pourquoi faudrait-il dire
« bonsoir » ? Bon solstice, plutôt !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Oui, bon solstice à toi, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Le soleil ne se couchera pas ce soir.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Alors profite de la vie nocturne
{{TAG:000E:000A:0600640065002000040064002700}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}} sous un jour nouveau.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Buonasera!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Beh, non proprio.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Direi piuttosto
buon solstizio, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Il sole stasera non tramonta.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Quindi goditi {{TAG:0005:0005:}} sotto
una luce... diversa dal solito!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Guten Abend?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Nein, nein!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Das ist nicht angebracht.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Schönen {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Mittsommer{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Die Sonne geht heute nicht unter.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Du kannst also {{TAG:0005:0005:}} in einem
völlig neuen Licht genießen!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ciao, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Cosa ti porta qui {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
in questa notte così... luminosa?
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Aspetta, tu sapevi che oggi è il
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}solstizio d'estate{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, vero? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Il sole non
tramonta stasera, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Hola, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}, cariñín{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}No habrás venido a pasear bajo las
estrellas, ¿verdad, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Porque es el solsticio de verano.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
No habrá noche hasta mañana.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Salve, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Spero che tu non sia qui per una
passeggiata notturna, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sai, oggi è il {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}solstizio d'estate{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Di notte non se ne parla, almeno
per ora!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Hello there, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
You'd never guess it's the middle
of the night, right?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}But that's the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Summer Solstice{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
for you. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}It's the perfect night to
burn the candle at both ends.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Fíjate qué hora es, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
La verdad es que no me puedo
creer que ya sea de noche.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Pero así es el solsticio de verano. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Para mí que el sol se despista
hablando y no se acuerda de irse.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Bonsoir, bonsoir {{TAG:0005:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Difficile de croire que nous sommes
en pleine nuit...
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Le solstice d'été, c'est vraiment
particulier, étrange, extraordinaire...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
C'est pas génial, ça, {{TAG:0005:0007:}} ?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Ich grüße dich, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Man würde nie glauben, dass es
schon mitten in der Nacht ist, oder?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}So ist das eben an {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Mittsommer{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Heute kann man perfekt die Nacht
zum Tag machen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Hihi!
